# VivoQuest Patient Mobile App (Release Bundle)
Version: 1.0.0
Environment: Development / Sandbox
Target: Android / Expo Go

To install and run:
1. Scan the QR code on the website with your Android phone camera or Expo Go.
2. Expo Metro Bundler address: exp://10.151.164.41:8081
3. For standalone APK builds, run `npx expo run:android` in apps/mobile-patient.

